// AREA isles: the Dusk grunt holding the Emberkey lens. Repeatable until the
// lens is back (lose, heal, climb again).

## The lamp room

::bg{location="emberkey-beacon" time="day"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: The lamp room at the top of the Emberkey beacon is hot as an oven. A grunt in a grey coat is trying to fit the great lens into a sack.
@duskGruntCinder{code="0010"}: This lens is Remnant property now. Nyx says so.
::use{component="trainerBattle" who="duskGruntCinder" intro="Back down the stairs, Champion. Or go down them faster." win="Hot. Too hot. Take it!" lose="Stairs are that way." prize="1800" instance="use-001"}
::assert{islesLensBack(emberkey) when="@wonFight"}
@narrator{code="0020" when="@wonFight"}: The lens is heavier than it looks. Keeper Brand will want it back.
